OL,3,GNEWSACauseway rescue after five people
OL,4,Astranded in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo adults and three children were
OL,7,Frescued from a car after getting stuck
OL,8,Fin a rising tide on a tidal causeway.
OL,10,FSeahouses RNLI said there had been a
OL,11,F"significant multi-agency response"
OL,12,Fafter five people became stranded in a
OL,13,Fvehicle which had drifted off into the
OL,14,Fsea between Holy Island and
OL,15,FNorthumberland mainland at about 17:00
OL,16,FBST on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
