OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACauseway rescue after five people
OL,4,Astranded in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe five people were returned safely to
OL,7,Fshore but Seahouses RNLI said "what
OL,8,Fcould have been a family journey home
OL,9,Fcould have had a very different
OL,10,Foutcome" adding "safe crossing times
OL,11,Fwere there for a reason".
OL,13,FThe RNLI warned it was "another stark
OL,14,Freminder of just how quickly the tide
OL,15,Fcan turn on the Holy Island causeway".
